  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roadmap for sustainable spices export from Myanmar to the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to develop a roadmap for market access to the Netherlands of sustainably produced spices from Myanmar.The outcome will:&#x2022;	Provide insight into product, market and sustainability requirements of Dutch traders and processors of spices.&#x2022;	Describe to which extent Myanmar producers can comply with these requirements and possible measures to close the gaps.With well-guided support and improved business opportunities, Myanmar can further develop its spices sector and increase the profitability for farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
